102: +    """The `read-source` command wraps its result as {"payload": {...}} while the other commands
103: +    print their keys flat, so reading `content` or `label` off the top level silently sees None and
104: +    the check fails for the envelope rather than for the file browser. Unwrap when the envelope is
105: +    there and fall through when it is not, so this keeps working whichever shape a caller produces.
106: +    """
